# Local-only secrets for `npm run dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` — which is
# gitignored — and fill in. Deployed secrets are set with `wrangler secret put`
# instead; this file never leaves your machine.
SHARED_SECRET="local-dev-secret"

# Optional. Without these, /feedback and /explain return 503 locally, exactly
# as they do in production when unconfigured.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=""
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=""
